# Claude Code harness worktrees / local state
.claude/

# Agency's own worktrees + local state for this repo, issue files included.
# The app rewrites .agency/issues/*.md on every status change, so tracking them
# kept this checkout dirty (which is what merges refuse to start on) and put the
# same frontmatter lines on both sides of every agent merge. One local copy,
# shared by every worktree.
.agency/
